<span id="A1.T5.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">You believe taxes are a burden to the small businesses in your neighborhood.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
