</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">You believe Medicare is a good program.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
