<span id="A1.T5.2.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">You are a college football coach whose students’ salaries is higher than your own.</span>
</span></td></tr>
